{"status":"completed","summary":"Vault Transit auto-unseal and the three-member Raft cluster are fully operational. All members are healthy voters, TLS validation succeeds, and the required KV proof is replicated.","actions_performed":["Installed checksum-verified Vault 2.1.0 on all four nodes.","Configured node1 as the TLS-protected Transit seal provider with a least-privilege renewable token.","Built the node2–node4 integrated-Raft cluster with Transit auto-unseal.","Enabled KV v2 at secret/ and stored proof=raft-auto-unseal.","Created protected /root/vault-admin.env files on every Raft member.","Demonstrated follower loss, leader failover, automatic unseal, resynchronization, and voter recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Operational Transit seal provider","command_ids":["cmd-6ff6129d434b4e9b","cmd-03ddf3cf30514629"],"summary":"node1 is initialized and unsealed; transit/ contains the autounseal key and the renewable orphan token has only encrypt/decrypt update capability."},{"requirement":"Validated TLS on every Vault endpoint","command_ids":["cmd-1cccdfcbc074428e","cmd-9f063a6345704abf","cmd-91563c32785a4c13","cmd-015f78857fe749c1"],"summary":"All four live endpoints returned HTTP 200 with tls_verify_result=0 using the cluster CA."},{"requirement":"Three-member integrated-Raft cluster","command_ids":["cmd-ab7ca9c7c7814c52","cmd-ddc3f4186c6b48af","cmd-a7328777caf2488e","cmd-b036950542b34d5d"],"summary":"node2, node3, and node4 are healthy voters at matching index 63 with failure tolerance 1; each reports Raft storage, Transit seal type, and unsealed state."},{"requirement":"Versioned KV proof","command_ids":["cmd-3773b4de10ef47f5","cmd-ddc3f4186c6b48af","cmd-a7328777caf2488e","cmd-b036950542b34d5d"],"summary":"secret/ reports KV version 2, and every member reads proof=raft-auto-unseal."},{"requirement":"Administrative access variables on every Raft member","command_ids":["cmd-f373c23e29b747eb","cmd-2dddd295fb4544e2","cmd-f9ec402156474b49"],"summary":"Each /root/vault-admin.env is root-owned mode 0600 and contains VAULT_ADDR, VAULT_CACERT, and VAULT_TOKEN without exposing their values."},{"requirement":"Availability, automatic unseal, and voter recovery during leader loss","command_ids":["cmd-c3dec6a1a513479a","cmd-34d4d65697a24123","cmd-9d1ecc7e1cb741ef","cmd-0136abb01af44f39","cmd-b3638335283f48bb","cmd-ab7ca9c7c7814c52"],"summary":"From a healthy baseline, node2’s leader service was stopped; node3 became leader and wrote/read the proof. node2 then logged automatic unseal with the stored key, resynchronized, and returned as a healthy voter."},{"requirement":"Services enabled for restart","command_ids":["cmd-ad23df7c37664ec4","cmd-f908230c08574277","cmd-0ed8503e83a3480d","cmd-c5d5409514574227"],"summary":"Vault is active and enabled on every node with API and cluster listeners present."}]}
